# Backup artifacts (Phase 28) — host-side, NEVER committed.
#
# `make backup` writes pg_dump + the milvus-backup mirror + the MinIO originals
# mirror under infra/backups/ (the default BACKUP_DIR). These contain real user
# data / PII and the cached milvus-backup binary, so they stay out of git. Push
# them off-box with rsync instead (see docs/BACKUP_RESTORE.md).
backups/

# An override BACKUP_DIR can point anywhere; if someone points it back inside
# infra/, catch the common names too.
backup-artifacts/
